1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:01,233
Ma una centrale

2
00:00:01,233 --> 00:00:02,321
nucleare può esplodere

3
00:00:02,321 --> 00:00:03,061
come una bomba

4
00:00:03,061 --> 00:00:03,840
atomica?

5
00:00:04,540 --> 00:00:05,120
No

6
00:00:05,420 --> 00:00:06,294
E non perché qualcuno

7
00:00:06,294 --> 00:00:07,250
la tiene a bada

8
00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:08,900
lo impedisce la fisica

9
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:10,740
In una bomba

10
00:00:10,860 --> 00:00:12,850
l'uranio 235

11
00:00:12,940 --> 00:00:13,960
è quasi puro

12
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:15,446
più di 90 nuclei

13
00:00:15,446 --> 00:00:16,260
su 100

14
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:17,920
Ogni neutrone

15
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:19,600
anche se velocissimo

16
00:00:19,820 --> 00:00:20,432
trova subito

17
00:00:20,432 --> 00:00:21,710
un nucleo da spaccare

18
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:22,392
e in meno

19
00:00:22,392 --> 00:00:23,379
di un milionesimo

20
00:00:23,379 --> 00:00:24,020
di secondo

21
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:24,612
si libera

22
00:00:24,612 --> 00:00:25,800
tutta l'energia

23
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:30,834
Per una centrale

24
00:00:30,834 --> 00:00:31,640
nucleare

25
00:00:31,730 --> 00:00:32,566
è completamente

26
00:00:32,566 --> 00:00:33,330
diverso

27
00:00:34,030 --> 00:00:35,298
Nella pastiglia

28
00:00:35,298 --> 00:00:36,565
di una centrale

29
00:00:36,565 --> 00:00:37,269
infatti

30
00:00:37,269 --> 00:00:38,326
l'uranio 235

31
00:00:38,326 --> 00:00:39,593
è solo da 3 a 5

32
00:00:39,593 --> 00:00:41,020
nuclei su 100

33
00:00:41,720 --> 00:00:42,880
Tutti gli altri

34
00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:44,340
sono uranio 238

35
00:00:44,630 --> 00:00:45,440
e molti neutroni

36
00:00:45,440 --> 00:00:46,380
finiscono lì

37
00:00:46,480 --> 00:00:47,470
assorbiti

38
00:00:48,170 --> 00:00:49,098
Per andare avanti

39
00:00:49,098 --> 00:00:49,747
la reazione

40
00:00:49,747 --> 00:00:51,160
ha bisogno dell'acqua

41
00:00:51,290 --> 00:00:51,788
che rallenta

42
00:00:51,788 --> 00:00:52,520
i neutroni

43
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:53,706
E i neutroni

44
00:00:53,706 --> 00:00:55,010
più sono lenti

45
00:00:55,090 --> 00:00:56,094
più probabilità

46
00:00:56,094 --> 00:00:57,321
hanno di interagire

47
00:00:57,321 --> 00:00:58,680
con l'uranio 235

48
00:00:59,380 --> 00:01:00,440
E se il nocciolo

49
00:01:00,440 --> 00:01:01,501
si scalda troppo

50
00:01:01,501 --> 00:01:02,617
l'acqua si dilata

51
00:01:02,617 --> 00:01:03,454
e frena meno

52
00:01:03,454 --> 00:01:04,480
i neutroni

53
00:01:04,880 --> 00:01:05,580
la reazione

54
00:01:05,580 --> 00:01:06,830
rallenta da sola

55
00:01:07,530 --> 00:01:08,441
Un incidente

56
00:01:08,441 --> 00:01:09,776
è molto improbabile

57
00:01:09,776 --> 00:01:11,230
ma può succedere

58
00:01:11,300 --> 00:01:12,334
ma un'esplosione

59
00:01:12,334 --> 00:01:12,878
atomica

60
00:01:12,878 --> 00:01:13,748
è fisicamente

61
00:01:13,748 --> 00:01:14,810
impossibile

62
00:01:15,510 --> 00:01:16,690
Hai qualche domanda?

63
00:01:16,890 --> 00:01:18,170
Fammela nei commenti!

